[00:25.05]1. Firm and determined in this time of the end,
[00:29.05]Prepared are God’s servants the good news to defend.
[00:34.81]The Devil has fought and opposed them.
[00:40.09]With Jehovah, they take their stand against him.
[00:43.56](Chorus)
[00:47.04]Then forward, you Witnesses, ever strong of heart!
[00:51.84]Rejoice that in God’s work, you too may have a part!
[00:57.64]Go tell far and wide that the Paradise is near
[01:03.04]And that soon all its blessings will be here.
[01:26.49]2. Servants of Jah do not seek a life of ease;
[01:31.89]The world and its rulers we do not try to please.
[01:37.61]Unspotted at all times remaining,
[01:42.89]Our integrity we will keep maintaining.
[01:45.83](Chorus)
[01:48.76]Then forward, you Witnesses, ever strong of heart!
[01:54.76]Rejoice that in God’s work, you too may have a part!
[02:00.52]Go tell far and wide that the Paradise is near
[02:05.96]And that soon all its blessings will be here.
[02:36.48]3. God and his Kingdom are mocked and pushed aside;
[02:43.87]His great name is slandered, its holiness denied.
[02:51.27]Let’s share in its sanctification,
[02:58.66]And declare it to ev’ry tribe and nation.
[03:06.05](Chorus)
[03:13.45]Then forward, you Witnesses, ever strong of heart!
[03:20.84]Rejoice that in God’s work, you too may have a part!
[03:28.24]Go tell far and wide that the Paradise is near
[03:35.63]And that soon all its blessings will be here.